The following factors, among others, could cause actual results to differ materially from those described in the forward-looking statements:

● | the Company’s ability to continue as a going concern and its future liquidity and capital resources;

● | the Company’s ability to continue as a going concern and its future liquidity and capital resources;

● | the Company’s ability to obtain additional financing on acceptable terms, or at all;

